Z||000001||Sage||07-07-2001||09:54 PM||||Nice pics!  We,(myself,wife,two sons,and their girlfreinds),were there around 11:30A.M. for about an hour.  Don't see pics of RG's,(from Columbus),crimson masterpiece!  That is a sweet ride Roger.  There were some very nice Fiero's there and some well done modifications too.  One that wasn't even in the show looked pretty sweet too.  A Black GT,(not sure what year) lowered 2 1/2" in front and 2" in rear.  Nice set of 16" wheels,(I think) and just as clean as a pin.  One of my sons took some pics I will see if I can get some from him.<P>Sold one baby scoop while we there too!<P>Thanks for sharing the  pics.<P>Have a good one!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
